# ============================================================
# orbit: leo_noon -- sun-synchronous, 550 km, noon to midnight
# ============================================================
# The Sun lies in the plane (beta near 0 degrees), so every orbit has its
# longest eclipse, about 35 minutes of 96: the cold case. Open it in the GUI's
# Plans tab to see it propagated on the wall clock (docs/ORBIT.md).
#
# J2 turns the plane with the Sun, about a degree a day, so it keeps its local
# time all year.

